NAME
    console - Inspect or change text-console colours and caret presentation.

SYNOPSIS
    console
    console fg <red> <green> <blue>
    console bg <red> <green> <blue>
    console colors <fr> <fg> <fb> <br> <bg> <bb>
    console caret <blink|visible|off>
    console caret size <1-100>

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    With no arguments, shows the current text-console foreground/background RGB values,
    caret visibility mode and caret height. RGB components are decimal values from 0 to 255.

    caret size is a percentage of the character body: 1 is a thin underline and 100 is a
    full-cell block. caret blink makes it blink, visible keeps it continuously visible while
    the shell is accepting input, and off disables it.

    SDK authors can set the same policy from C# through Inu.Userland.Runtime.ConsolePresentation.

FILES
    /System/Commands/CONSOLE.EXE
    /System/Help/CONSOLE.MAN
